         </Value>
         <Value ColumnRef="Definition">
            <SimpleValue>The Party who combines individual smaller consignments into a single larger shipment (a so-called consolidated consignment or shipment) which is sent to a counterpart who mirrors the consolidator's activity by dividing the consolidated consignment into its original components.</SimpleValue>
         </Value>
         <Value ColumnRef="DictionaryEntryName">
            <SimpleValue>Customs Declaration. Freight Forwarder_ Party. Party</SimpleValue>
         </Value>
