      <Row><!--2356-->
         <Value ColumnRef="ModelName">
            <SimpleValue>UBL-CommonLibrary-2.5</SimpleValue>
         </Value>
         <Value ColumnRef="ComponentName">
            <SimpleValue>Shipment</SimpleValue>
         </Value>
         <Value ColumnRef="Definition">
            <SimpleValue>A class defining an identifiable collection of one or more goods items to be transported between the seller party and the buyer party. This information may be defined within a commercial contract. A shipment can be transported in different consignments (e.g., split for logistical purposes).</SimpleValue>
         </Value>
         <Value ColumnRef="DictionaryEntryName">
            <SimpleValue>Shipment. Details</SimpleValue>
         </Value>
         <Value ColumnRef="ObjectClass">
            <SimpleValue>Shipment</SimpleValue>
         </Value>
         <Value ColumnRef="ComponentType">
            <SimpleValue>ABIE</SimpleValue>
         </Value>
         <Value ColumnRef="CurrentVersion">
            <SimpleValue>2.0</SimpleValue>
         </Value>
         <Value ColumnRef="EditorsNotes">
            <SimpleValue>Change for UBL 2.0 Update Package: (a) Definition (cell Q854) changed from Information about a shipment. to An identifiable collection of one or more goods items to be transported between the seller party and the buyer party. This information may be defined within a commercial contract. A shipment can be transported in different consignments (e.g., split for logistical purposes). (b) Consignment removed from Alternative Business Terms (cell N854) </SimpleValue>
         </Value>
      </Row>
